B.aGX=new A.cf("\ud83d\ude8c","Bus Kota","City Bus","Transjakarta adalah BRT pertama di Asia Tenggara.","Transjakarta was the first BRT system in Southeast Asia.",B.lg)
B.aHb=new A.cf("\ud83c\udfeb","Sekolah","School","Indonesia punya jutaan murid SD di seluruh nusantara.","Indonesia has millions of elementary students across the archipelago.",B.dz)
