B.Rd=new A.H("Group Work","The school task is split into groups. Share the work fairly.","Everyone does their part \u2014 that is fair and light.",B.a1)
B.Um=new A.H("Clean the City River","The people work together to clear trash from the city river.","A clean river means a healthy city. Pitch in too.",B.V)
B.Tj=new A.H("Thank the Workers","The cleaners work at dawn. Kiko says thank you.","Appreciate others' work with sincere words.",B.ab)
