B.T2=new A.H("Mangrove Roots","The mangrove forest is where little fish hide and grow.",u.N,B.F)
B.Tz=new A.H("Ghost Net","An old net is snagged on the coral, putting fish in danger.","Remove the dangerous \u2014 save many small lives.",B.V)
B.Rl=new A.H("Murky Water","The sea is murky from land waste. The fish can hardly breathe.","Care for the water at home \u2014 the sea stays clean too.",B.V)
B.Tr=new A.H("Blue Whale","A giant blue whale passes slowly. Give it room and admire it.","The big need not be feared \u2014 just respected.",B.F)
