B.Sp=new A.H("Zero Gravity","Things float in space. Tidy them up so nothing gets lost.","Be neat and orderly \u2014 wherever you are.",B.a1)
B.R9=new A.H("Earth from Above","From the window, Earth looks small, blue, and beautiful.","Earth is our only home \u2014 take good care of it.",B.F)
B.Rm=new A.H("Moon Footprint","A footprint on the moon can last thousands of years. Step carefully.","Every step leaves a mark \u2014 choose the good ones.",B.a1)
B.QP=new A.H("Save Oxygen","In space, air and water are limited. Use just enough.","Save the limited \u2014 in space and on Earth.",B.a1)
B.SE=new A.H("Star Guide","Long ago, sailors used the stars to find their way.","Learn from those before us \u2014 knowledge is a legacy.",B.ab)
