B.ST=new A.H("Red Planet","Mars is dusty and cold. The scientists want to understand it.","Curiosity takes people far \u2014 keep it alive.",B.a1)
B.Uw=new A.H("Asteroid Belt","Many space rocks fly by. The team reminds each other to stay safe.","Remind each other for good \u2014 that shows you care.",B.F)
B.Uf=new A.H("Signal to Earth","Kiko sends good news to his family back on Earth.","Tell your loved ones \u2014 they are always waiting.",B.F)
B.Rc=new A.H("Distant Star","The star we see is really light from long ago.","What you do today can have an effect for a long time.",B.a1)
B.T6=new A.H("Warm Sun","The sun gives light and energy to the whole Earth.","Bring good to many people, like the sun.",B.F)
B.Vh=new A.H("Ringed Planet","Saturn has lovely rings of ice and rock. Amazing!","Learning makes us admire nature even more.",B.ab)
B.R5=new A.H("Giant Telescope","A giant telescope can see far galaxies. The work of scientists.","Value the hard work of those who advance knowledge.",B.ab)
