B.R6=new A.H("Vast Galaxy","The galaxy is so vast. We are small, but we still matter.","However small you are, your kindness matters.",B.a1)
B.SG=new A.H("Rocket Trouble","One part of the rocket breaks. The team fixes it calmly.","Face problems calmly and work together.",B.a1)
