B.Rr=new A.H("Getting Ready to Go Home","The mission is almost done. Kiko misses his family on Earth.","However great the adventure, home is still special.",B.F)
B.S6=new A.H("Safe Landing","The rocket lands smoothly thanks to the whole team working together.","Big success is always the result of working together.",B.a1)
B.TR=new A.H("Stories to Friends","Kiko shares his space knowledge and stories with his friends.","Share good knowledge \u2014 kindness becomes contagious.",B.F)
